## JavaScript

In this example we use [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/en/) (v14.21.0+) with the [node-fetch](https://www.npmjs.com/package/node-fetch) module.

```bash

# install node-fetch
npm install node-fetch
```

```javascript

const appKey = 'Your Application API key';
const accessToken = 'Your access token';
const mowerId = 'Your mower id';
```

### List mowers

```javascript

const requestOptions = {
  headers: {
    'Authorization': `Bearer ${accessToken}`,
    'X-Api-Key': appKey,
    'Authorization-Provider': 'husqvarna'
  }
};

const mowersResponse = await fetch('https://api.amc.husqvarna.dev/v1/mowers', requestOptions);
if (mowersResponse.ok) {
  // Your code...
}
```

