## curl

Examples with curl:

### List mowers

```bash

curl -X GET \
  https://api.amc.husqvarna.dev/v1/mowers \
  -H 'Authorization: Bearer &lt;access_token&gt;' \
  -H 'Authorization-Provider: husqvarna' \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/vnd.api+json' \
  -H 'X-Api-Key: &lt;Application API Key&gt;'
```

### Get specific mower

```bash

curl -X GET \
  https://api.amc.husqvarna.dev/v1/mowers/<mower_id> \
  -H 'Authorization: Bearer &lt;access_token&gt;' \
  -H 'Authorization-Provider: husqvarna' \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/vnd.api+json' \
  -H 'X-Api-Key: &lt;Application API Key&gt;'
```

