## Python

In this example we use [Python](https://www.python.org/) (v3+). IOt can be donwloaded at [download here](https://www.python.org/downloads/).

```python

import requests

appKey = "&lt;Application API key&gt;"
accessToken = "&lt;access_token&gt;"
mowerId = "&lt;mower_id&gt;"
```

### List mowers

```python

headers = {
  "Authorization": "Bearer "+accessToken,
  "X-Api-Key": appKey,
  "Authorization-Provider": "husqvarna"
}

url = "https://api.amc.husqvarna.dev/v1/mowers"
mowersResponse = requests.get(url, headers = headers)
print(mowersResponse.json())
```

### Get specific mower

```python

url = "https://api.amc.husqvarna.dev/v1/mowers/"+mowerId
mowersResponse = requests.get(url, headers = headers)
print(mowersResponse.json())
```

### Pause mower

```python

headers = {
