## Limits

The following limitations currently apply to the Automower® Connect API:

- Max 1 request per second and `appKey`.
- Max 10 000 request per month and `appKey`.

Any additional requests above these limits will be throttled.

## Summary

By using the Automower® Connect API you can control Husqvarna Automower® based on your needs. You have the opportunity to send commands such as pause, start and park as well as read the current status of your mowers.

In the [Open API documentation](https://developer.husqvarnagroup.cloud/apis/Automower+Connect+API#openapi) you can see exactly how to structure your `data.type` body to make these requests.

